{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB熱播劇《璀璨之城》除了主線劇情緊張刺激，劇中一段已成追憶的虐心戀——Sarah（陳瀅飾）與Annie（陳曉華飾）的同性CP線，竟意外跑出大受歡迎！二人之間充滿遺憾的愛情故事令觀眾大為感動，不但互動火花四濺，連帶劇中的「定情雞尾酒」也意外爆紅，成為網民熱搜對象！\n</p>\n<h2>Sarah Annie CP感爆棚 網民自製「愛MV」</h2>\n<p>雖然Annie一角在劇集開初已逝世，但她與Sarah之間的回憶片段卻充滿愛意，讓這對CP極速入屋。由於劇情鋪排得層層遞進，加上陳瀅與陳曉華的互動火花十足，不少網民早已猜到Sarah暗戀Annie。這對CP的受歡迎程度超乎預期，在昨晚劇情正式揭曉前，已有大量粉絲為二人製作「愛的MV」在網上流傳，可見其魅力非凡。</p>\n<h2>定情酒Echoes of Time爆紅 網民熱搜「情深說話未曾講Cocktail」</h2>\n<p>劇中一個極具象徵意義的物品——Sarah與Annie的「定情」雞尾酒「Echoes of Time」，隨著這對CP爆紅而意外掀起熱潮。這杯被網民形容為「情深說話未曾講Cocktail」的飲品，代表著二人之間未曾宣之於口的愛意，充滿浪漫而遺憾的色彩。不少觀眾都對這杯雞尾酒產生濃厚興趣，紛紛在網上查詢其配方，甚至詢問現實中有哪些酒吧可以喝到，成為劇集延伸的一大有趣熱話。</p>\n<h2>愈遺憾愈感動 虐心設定成入屋關鍵</h2>\n<p>Sarah與Annie這對CP之所以能觸動人心，其「虐心」的設定是關鍵。一個是已香消玉殞的白月光，一個是為愛復仇的癡情者，這種「愈遺憾愈令人難忘」的悲劇愛情，成功勾起了觀眾的憐愛與共鳴。劇中一幕「陳曉華睡著一幕真的很美」的畫面，更成為粉絲心中的經典場景，淒美的氛圍讓這段關係更添幾分宿命感，成功俘虜大批觀眾的心。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版大讚襯到絕：「兩個都靚到冇得頂」</h2>\n<p>網民對Sarah與Annie這對CP的喜愛幾乎一面倒，紛紛留言大讚二人襯到絕，火花十足。討論區被相關留言洗版：「她們的故事愈看愈遺憾」、「真係好感動」、「很好嗑的 CP」、「眼神充滿故事」。不少觀眾更投入劇情，表達對這段關係的惋惜：「好希望 Annie未死，咁佢哋就可以 Live happily ever after」。亦有網民稱讚兩位演員的顏值：「呢個配搭又幾有 Chem」、「兩個都靚到冇得頂」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_20509907606ae42df82f4d5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_20509907606ae42df82f4d5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_11813751346ae42dfb31e12.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_11813751346ae42dfb31e12.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_16825283616ae42dfe339d6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_16825283616ae42dfe339d6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_11366675056ae42e0366d93.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_11366675056ae42e0366d93.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/27_10677141496ae42e063d79f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/27_10677141496ae42e063d79f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_13105646796ae42e09a0964.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_13105646796ae42e09a0964.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_15332629486ae42e0d0c8ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_15332629486ae42e0d0c8ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_17393299426ae42e1310cb8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_17393299426ae42e1310cb8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_7925268606ae42e175049f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_7925268606ae42e175049f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_16941599636ae42e1be1da6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_16941599636ae42e1be1da6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:43:44.546839+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1265,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:30:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:19:34.869766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:39:23.529649+00:00","content_hash":"2d10480db081b36a6d5f52da6fd92da49792b0e4eb2db8dda4bd725748ba7dfa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}